abstract: >-
  A curated research map of coding agents that create, execute, evaluate,
  and improve robot-learning systems, spanning Code as Policy, simulation
  and task generation, reward design, robot evaluation, synthetic data,
  and agentic policy training.
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - robot learning
  - robotics
